From: Plain Browser
Subject: [ui] About page: the Chromium and ungoogled-chromium versions and the ad blocking components

Category: 60-ui. chrome://settings/help gets a block under the copyright line: "Based on Chromium X and
ungoogled-chromium Y" and "Ad blocking: adblock-rust Z with the EasyList, EasyPrivacy and EasyList Polish filter
lists". The strings are built in //plainbrowser/shields/ui/shields_settings_strings.cc (already called from the
settings strings provider, 60-ui/0009) from plainbrowser/common/version.h, which scripts/sync-version.py generates
from versions.toml and the adblock crate pin; the texts are in the shields grdp (60-ui/0008). This patch only adds
the markup.
---
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/settings/about_page/about_page.html.ts
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/settings/about_page/about_page.html.ts
@@ -112,6 +112,13 @@
       <div class="secondary">$i18n{aboutProductCopyright}</div>
     </div>
 
+    <!-- Plain Browser: the upstream versions and the components it uses
+         (strings: //plainbrowser/shields/ui/shields_settings_strings.cc). -->
+    <div class="info-section">
+      <div class="secondary">$i18n{plainBrowserAboutBase}</div>
+      <div class="secondary">$i18n{plainBrowserAboutComponents}</div>
+    </div>
+
     <div class="info-section">
       <div class="secondary">$i18nRaw{aboutProductLicense}</div>
     </div>
